OL,3,GNEWSAListed status for payphone at
OL,4,Acentre of Great Britain
OL,5,
OL,6,FA telephone box that sits at the
OL,7,Fgeographic centre of Great Britain has
OL,8,Fbeen given Grade II-listed status.
OL,10,FThe KX100 kiosk at Dunsop Bridge, in
OL,11,FRibble Valley in Lancashire, was the
OL,12,F100,000th telephone kiosk to be
OL,13,Finstalled in the country.
OL,15,FIt was officially opened in June 1992
OL,16,Fby explorer Sir Ranulph Fiennes, who
OL,17,Fmade the first call from the kiosk; he
OL,18,Fwas joined by children from nearby
OL,19,FThornleyholme RC Primary School.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
