OL,5,
OL,6,FJayne Rimmer, Historic England's north
OL,7,Fregion listing team leader, said: "As
OL,8,Fpart of the last generation of the
OL,9,Fpublic telephone box, it is a
OL,10,Fnationally significant kiosk."
